OL,3,GNEWSABridge repair planned after
OL,4,Anine-month lane closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FRepairs are planned in the autumn to a
OL,7,Fbridge which was damaged by a lorry in
OL,8,FJanuary.
OL,10,FThe lorry was carrying a digger when it
OL,11,Fstruck the Watchorn Roundabout above
OL,12,Fthe A38 dual carriageway in Alfreton,
OL,13,FDerbyshire.
OL,15,FFollowing an initial full closure by
OL,16,FNational Highways, one of the
OL,17,Froundabout's two lanes has remained
OL,18,Fshut for more than nine months.
OL,20,FIn January, the roads authority said
OL,21,Fthe work would take "time to plan and
OL,22,Fdeliver".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
